# BOND UI

- Brand first: “BOND” is a hero-level signal; use logo assets from `src/assets/`.
- Home hero: full-viewport cinematic composition (black upper field, immersive art, glass pill, entrance motion). Adapt Orbit scaling spirit via CSS `--u`; do not copy Orbit product copy.
- Lucide icons only. No emoji.
- Dashboard: dense, restrained, dark; Pending = warning tone, Finalized = success.
- One job per section. Prefer composition over card chrome unless interaction needs a container.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Fonts: Manrope + Space Grotesk already in root — keep brand coherent.
